## Acceptance and readiness basis

The release target is the exact Authoritative State for which the whole-method re-audit reported:

```text
readiness=READY_FOR_1_0_RELEASE_CANDIDATE
blockers=0
stabilization_actions=0
total_findings=0
```

No method-corpus mutation is performed to manufacture the release identity.

## Authority boundary

The annotated tag authorizes identification of this state as **STATE Engineering 1.0-RC1**.

It does not establish the later stable **STATE Engineering 1.0** release.

